        },
        {
          "text": "Davida wakati, Ncobeni Jehova mbwali muumi, Jehova nguuyoomujaya, nanka buzuba bwakwe bwakufwa buyoosika bwini, nanka ulanjila munkondo kuti imujaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
