        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Davida naakamana kubweza isumo ankomo yamaanzi zyakali kumutwe wa-Saulo, bakainka, nkabela taakwe iwakababona, taakwe iwakezi makani, taakwe iwakasinsimuka, pe, boonse bakali mukuona, nkaambo iŋonzi zizwa kuli-Jehova zyakalibajayide.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.12",
