                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Saulo wakati, Ndabisya, Piluka, mwanaangu Davida, nkaambo nsikooyookubisizya limbi pe, mbuli buumi bwangu mbubwayandika mumeso aako sunu. Ncobeni ndalifubeede akuleya loko malaa.",
          "type": "text",
