        {
          "text": "Mpawo Saulo wakaambila Davida kuti, Koba acoolwe, mwanaangu Davida. Kucita ulacita akuzunda ulazunda. Elyo Davida wakainka, alakwe Saulo wakabweeda kulimbabo.",
